          type: text-cell-p
          content: >-
            Final decision: PROCEED

            Accept the proposed decision because all validated regions are on track,
            quality scores meet the 0.95 threshold, and portfolio forecast of $7,770.2k
            exceeds the $6,000.0k target despite Europe’s backfilled-data risk.

            Strongest OpenAI point: it identifies Europe as target-clearing but requiring
            weekly data-quality monitoring because of backfill risk.

            Strongest Anthropic point: it emphasizes that portfolio-level forecast
            strength, alongside every region being on track, supports proceeding.

            Concrete next action: audit Europe’s backfilled revenue inputs before the next
            reporting cycle and intervene if quality drops below 0.95 or forecast falls
            below target.
